OL,3,GNEWSABeavers 'could boost wildlife and
OL,4,Atackle drought'
OL,5,
OL,6,FSupporters of a plan to reintroduce
OL,7,Fbeavers to a county say they could help
OL,8,Flandscapes become more resilient to
OL,9,Fdrought and climate change.
OL,11,FGloucestershire Wildlife Trust and
OL,12,FForestry England are surveying
OL,13,Fdifferent parts of the county to assess
OL,14,Ftheir suitability for a new
OL,15,Freintroduction programme.
OL,17,F"Beavers are a keystone species" said
OL,18,FEmily Bowen of the Beaver Trust. "They
OL,19,Fare ecosystem engineers, which means
OL,20,Fthat they can have a massive impact on
OL,21,Fthe landscape around them."
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
