OL,3,GNEWSABeavers 'could boost wildlife and
OL,4,Atackle drought'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Department for Environment, Food
OL,7,Fand Rural Affairs (Defra), which would
OL,8,Fhave to approve the measure, said it
OL,9,Fcould make a "huge difference to nature
OL,10,Frecovery".
